#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "What is a Mithqál?"
msgstr "Yini i-Mithqál?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "A mithqál is a traditional unit of weight used in the Middle East, equivalent to approximately 3.642 grams. In the Bahá'í Faith, it holds special significance as it is used to calculate Huqúqu'lláh (the Right of God), a spiritual obligation for Bahá'ís to contribute 19% of their surplus wealth after essential expenses (only if the individuals net worth is worth 19 Mithqáls of gold or more)."
msgstr "I-mithqál iyunithi yesisindo evamile esetshenziswa eMpumalanga Ephakathi, elingana namagremu angu-3.642. Okholweni lwe-Bahá'í, lunokubaluleka okukhethekile njengoba lusetshenziselwa ukubala i-Huqúqu'lláh (Ilungelo LikaNkulunkulu), okuyisibopho esingokomoya sama-Bahá'ís sokunikela ngo-19% womcebo wabo osalayo ngemva kwezindleko ezibalulekile (kuphela uma inani labantu libiza u-19 Mithqál wegolide)."

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "What is the Bahá'í Faith?"
msgstr "Luyini Ukholo lwe-Bahá'í?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Why are there advertisements?"
msgstr "Kungani kunezikhangiso?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Do you have a mobile app?"
msgstr "Ingabe unalo uhlelo lokusebenza lweselula?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "In the works!"
msgstr "Emisebenzini!"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Where do the currency and metal rates come from?"
msgstr "Ivelaphi imali nezilinganiso zensimbi?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Gold and silver prices are fetched daily from Swissquote's forex data feed. For each metal, the calculator takes the midpoint of every valid bid/ask quote and uses the median of those midpoints. Currency exchange rates come from FXRatesAPI. The displayed timestamp shows when the latest complete snapshot was successfully retrieved."
msgstr "Izintengo zegolide nezesiliva zilandwa nsuku zonke kokuphakelayo kwedatha ye-forex ye-Swissquote. Ngensimbi ngayinye, isibali sithatha indawo emaphakathi yawo wonke amaphoyinti okubhida/okucela avumelekile futhi sisebenzisa imidiyeni yalawo maphoyinti aphakathi. Amanani okushintshanisa imali avela ku-FXRatesAPI. Isitembu sesikhathi esibonisiwe sibonisa ukuthi isifinyezo sakamuva esiphelele sitholwe nini ngempumelelo."

