msgstr "I-<0>Mithqál Calculator</0> iyithuluzi lamahhala elakhelwe ukusiza ukubala inani legolide nesiliva kuma-mithqáls, iyunithi yesisindo evamile esetshenziselwa <1>Huqúqu'lláh</1> Okholweni lwe-Bahá'í."

