#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "The Bahá'í Faith is a world religion founded by Bahá'u'lláh in 19th-century Persia. It teaches the essential oneness of all religions and the unity of humanity. Bahá'ís believe in progressive revelation, meaning that God has sent a series of divine messengers throughout history, including Abraham, Moses, Buddha, Jesus, Muhammad, and most recently Bahá'u'lláh. For more information, please visit <0>bahai.org</0>."
msgstr "I-Bahá'í Faith inkolo yomhlaba wonke eyasungulwa yi-Bahá'u'lláh ngekhulu le-19 lasePheresiya. Ifundisa ubunye obubalulekile bazo zonke izinkolo nobunye besintu. Bahá'ís bakholelwa ekwambulweni okuqhubekayo, okusho ukuthi uNkulunkulu uthumele uchungechunge lwezithunywa ezingcwele kuwo wonke umlando, kuhlanganise no-Abrahama, uMose, uBuddha, uJesu, uMuhammad, kanye nakamuva nje Bahá'u'lláh. Ukuze uthole ulwazi olwengeziwe, sicela uvakashele <0>bahai.org</0>."

